# General profile - modelled on the one Kunal built by hand in Options+.
#   logikit build "General (logikit)" --file general.keys --replace
#
# Targets: a URL | app:<path> | sys:<action> | text:<what to type>
#          wait:<ms> | a keyboard shortcut | steps chained with >>
# Keep anything private in a *.local.keys file (gitignored).

# ---------- Page 1: apps ----------
Claude      | app:/Applications/Claude.app                | #2B1B12 | #F0A882 | chat
